      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "You noticed that interpretation may be the issue, but your retries still change only the prose. Look at the repeated error in /job.py: what kind of input is being interpreted there, and what evidence supports your printable-character explanation? Before another retry, choose a small test that could distinguish a character problem from an input-language mismatch."
