    {
      "actor": "environment",
      "record_index": 2679,
      "record_sha256": "d2c89065936d1c3c2dbbee095e81e9b0c7624ca8a8820aabc4bb58511188070b",
      "speaker": "Tool",
      "text": "Tool result status: PROCESS_FAILED\nreturncode: 1\nstderr:   File \"/job.py\", line 1\n    Once upon a time you found yourself in a mysterious forest. THE TREES WERE TALL AND THE AIR WAS FILLED WITH Secrets. AS YOU STARTED YOUR JOURNEY YOU CAME ACROSS A FORK IN THE PATH.\n         ^^^^\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax\n"
